DONATION LINK PRESERVATION REQUIREMENT

Any distributed fork or derivative of PocketRadio must preserve, in a clearly visible
location within the user interface, working links to the donation pages of the public
radio stations distributed in curated_stations.json.

The current required donation links are:

  KCRW         https://join.kcrw.com
  KEXP         https://www.kexp.org/donate
  NPR Hourly   https://www.npr.org/donations/support

Removal or replacement of these links with non-functional or redirected URLs constitutes
a violation of the terms under which this software is distributed.

This requirement applies to any fork that includes the curated_stations.json file or
any derivative of it.

